{"id":"629201","name":"韭菜油条碎水饺","author":"还在吃吃吃","authorId":"10106890","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/629201/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"300克"},{"name":"韭菜","amount":"1把"},{"name":"油条","amount":"1根"},{"name":"油炸粉条碎","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"100ml"},{"name":"食盐","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"料油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香油","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"锅中烧油下入粉条碎炸香。","img":"images/629201/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"粉条碎瞬间发胖变得蓬松。","img":"images/629201/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"将韭菜段，鸡蛋碎，油条碎和油炸粉条碎装入盆中。","img":"images/629201/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入半勺食盐。","img":"images/629201/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"半勺胡椒粉。","img":"images/629201/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"半勺鸡精。","img":"images/629201/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入1勺生抽。","img":"images/629201/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入适量的料油。","img":"images/629201/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入香油。","img":"images/629201/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/629201/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"提前揉好的面团已经醒发好了。","img":"images/629201/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"将面团搓长条下面剂。","img":"images/629201/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"擀皮包上馅料。","img":"images/629201/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"包成自己熟悉的饺子形状。","img":"images/629201/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"锅中烧水沸腾后下入饺子。","img":"images/629201/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"煮两开捞出。","img":"images/629201/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}